# Keep LF in the repository and in every checkout, so a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true can still build the Docker images (a CRLF
# docker-entrypoint.sh fails with "no such file or directory") and patches
# from other machines apply cleanly.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.joblib binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
